  "description": "<p>As a follow-on to <del>FCREPO-2745</del>. The stable ACL Link header appears for all FedoraResources.</p>\n\n<p>But for versioning the ACL on the TimeMap should be used for permissions on all Mementos.</p>\n\n<p>Currently the link header does not appear when viewing the TimeMap, it should exist.</p>\n\n<p>Currently the link header does appear when viewing a Memento; it should not or should reference the TimeMap acl.</p>",
